# Trivy findings accepted on purpose (used by the container-scan job in
# security.yml). One CVE ID per line, each preceded by a comment giving the
# reason, who accepted it, and a review-by date:
#
# # Not reachable: we never call X. Accepted by Josui (CTO), review 2026-12-31
# CVE-2026-00000

# pip 26.2's vendored urllib3 2.7.0, msgpack 1.1.2 and pkg_resources
# (setuptools 70.3.0), reported from pip/_vendor/bom.cdx.json. pip ships in
# the Hummingbird python base, distroless runtime included, so it cannot be
# removed here; this service never runs pip. Drop these once the base ships
# a fixed pip. Accepted by Josui (CTO) 2026-10-16, review 2026-11-16.
CVE-2026-97687
CVE-2026-97689
GHSA-6v7p-g79w-8964
CVE-2025-47273

# certifi 2026.6.17 bundled in the Hummingbird python base (pip's vendored
# copy, pip/_vendor), CRITICAL GHSA-6q48-6c7w-9gw2, fixed in certifi
# 2026.10.19. Our OWN certifi is already 2026.10.19 (uv.lock, #515); this is
# the base image's bundled copy, which uv cannot bump, and this distroless
# service never runs pip so the vendored bundle is never loaded. Drop once the
# base ships a fixed pip. Accepted by Josui (CTO) 2026-10-22, review 2026-11-22.
GHSA-6q48-6c7w-9gw2
